{"id":"aveu","lemma":"aveu","pos":"noun","rank":3716,"glosses":["oath of allegiance","confession"],"ipa":"/a.vø/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/24/Fr-aveu.ogg/Fr-aveu.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"aveux"},"examples":[{"text":"Pourquoi avez-vous signé l'aveu ?","en":"Why did you sign the confession?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/334664","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to sign","l":"signer"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Vous n'auriez pas dû signer d'aveu.","en":"You shouldn't have signed a confession.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to sign"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"« Voici ton aveu. » « Je ne signerai pas ça. »","en":"\"Here's your confession.\" \"I'm not signing that.\"","words":[{"g":"here is"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to sign","l":"signer"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"On a eu recours à la torture pour leur arracher des aveux.","en":"Torture was used to wring confessions from them.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"recourse"},null,null,{"g":"torture"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"them"},{"g":"to uproot"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null],"phrases":[[4,6,"a la"]]},{"text":"« Tenez, voici votre aveu. » « Je ne signerai pas ça. »","en":"\"Here's your confession.\" \"I'm not signing that.\"","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tenir"},{"g":"here is"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to sign","l":"signer"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"that"}]}]}